    "title": "HOLD on a store's contents",
    "category": "Teaching",
    "description": "Trucks wait in a HOLD until two cases are staged at a packer. Cases arrive four at a time and are packed in threes, so the staged count rises and falls within one instant: the HOLD reads NS(\"pack\") and is re-evaluated when the store changes, not on a timer."
